# Publish ONLY the game(s). Ignore everything else in this working folder
# (the big PDFs/zips, backups, slide images, music, and local dev-only scripts
#  like serve.ps1 / the launcher / .claude all stay off the public site).
# Root-level rules are anchored (leading /) so they don't accidentally reach
# into subfolders like topdown/ that have their own files of the same name.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/title.html
!/README.md
# project instructions for Claude Code — must be tracked so a fresh session
# (or a fresh clone) picks it up automatically
!/CLAUDE.md
# topdown/ = the fresh top-down rebuild (in progress, lives alongside the
# original side-view game rather than replacing it)
!/topdown/
!/topdown/**
topdown/tools/balance-harness-results.json
